OL,3,AUS tech stocks see sharp falls as AI
OL,4,Aspending nears $1tn
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile tech firms are spending big on
OL,7,FAI, their earnings are not always
OL,8,Fmeeting analysts' expectations,
OL,9,Fspooking investors and creating fears
OL,10,Fof an AI bubble.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/19
