OL,3,ACelebrity Traitors comes to a climax in
OL,4,Anail-biting final
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpoiler warning: This story reveals
OL,7,Fdetails of The Celebrity Traitors final
OL,9,FWe've had four weeks of suspense,
OL,10,Fsuspicion and very suspect tactics, as
OL,11,Fsome of Britain's biggest stars engaged
OL,12,Fin a battle of wits to win the most
OL,13,Fpopular show on TV.
OL,15,FThe second series of BBC One's The
OL,16,FCelebrity Traitors reached its climax
OL,17,Fon Friday, with the 21 original
OL,18,Fcontestants having been reduced to
OL,19,Fseven before the final.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/19
